mitsumi:  Linux kernel version 1.1.59, with SCSI+IDE+Mitsumi CD support.
mitsumi:
mitsumi:  This is a Linux kernel with support for Mitsumi CD-ROM drives, as 
mitsumi:  well as full support for SCSI devices such as hard drives, tape
mitsumi:  drives, and SCSI CD-ROM drives. See the file 'mitsumi.cfg' for an
mitsumi:  exact list of included drivers.
mitsumi:
mitsumi:  This kernel also has support for PPP, UMSDOS, CSLIP, Ethernet,
mitsumi:  Ftape, and the PS/2 style mouse (but not other busmouse types).
